{"2520400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nox Mortalis", "steam_appid": 2520400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nox Mortalis is a retro-style open world survival game where you must gather resources, craft essential gear, and explore sinister dungeons. Face hellish creatures and fight to survive in this world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a rewarding sense of progression and has intense horror elements, keeping players on edge as they delve deeper into this nightmarish world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520400/extras/eb55def7e7ac45268efdd4ceb06bb42a.poster.avif?t=1784470315\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520400/extras/eb55def7e7ac45268efdd4ceb06bb42a.webm?t=1784470315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520400/extras/eb55def7e7ac45268efdd4ceb06bb42a.mp4?t=1784470315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PS1 aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric ambience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/Night system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore survival experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cave/dungeon exploration</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nox Mortalis is a retro-style open world survival game where you must gather resources, craft essential gear, and explore sinister dungeons. Face hellish creatures and fight to survive in this world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragrap